Ok, I've managed to get all the way down to the castle.  I've got
AC-10, SDSM, Helm of Brilliance, Magicbane, unicorn horn, ring of
conflict, and a luckstone, among other useful items.  Things that are
conspicuously missing are a means of levitation/water walking, a BoH,
a magic marker, a wand of polymorph, and any known attack spell.
Lesson learned: don't carry your Force Bolt spellbook around with you
while fire breathing monsters are around.  It got toasted long ago,
such that I've forgotten the spell.  I also have not found a magic
missile spellbook yet.

I'm XL 13, and have a good set of intrinsics going.  Still, the castle
is on DL 22, and, DL 20 & 21 were both very rough thanks to
regenerating trolls.  I've cleared out the left side of the castle
level thanks to judicious elbereth spamming, but I'm worried about
getting over to the other side of the moat and dealing with monsters
there.  Obviously I can go back up and find an instrument to play the
pass tune for the drawbridge, but I've also got a stashed oilskin
cloak and a wand of cold, so I could freeze part of the moat and walk
